\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Happy the souls to Jesus joined,
\par And saved by grace alone,
\par Walking in all His ways, they find
\par Their heaven on earth begun.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The church triumphant in Thy love,
\par Their mighty joys we know;
\par They sing the Lambs in hymns above,
\par And we in Hymns below.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thee in Thy glorious realm they praise,
\par And bow before Thy throne,
\par We in the kingdom of Thy grace:
\par The kingdoms are but one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The holy to the holiest leads,
\par From thence our spirits rise,
\par And he that in Thy statues treads
\par Shall meet Thee in the skies.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

